.pytest_cache
tests/__pycache__
# the models stage needs exactly one file from tests/ — the committed
# contract-valid ONNX fixture it falls back to on a network-less build — so the
# fallback is a plain file copy with no network and no pip; everything else
# under tests/ stays out of the build context
tests/*
!tests/fixtures
tests/fixtures/*
!tests/fixtures/model_fixture.onnx
problem_statement.md
spec.md
